Author: XYORAS Access contributors

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 1
    Revision: 0

Title: XYORAS Access
Summary: Accessibility for Pokemon Gen 6
Description: Speaks dialogue, menus, battles, and the map aloud for blind and low-vision players. Pokemon X, Y, Omega Ruby, and Alpha Sapphire.
Compatibility: Any

# Heap reserved for the plugin, taken from the game's own. eSpeak NG's voice
# data and synthesis buffers dominate it; see "AI docks/05-plugin-architecture.md".
#
# 3gxtool accepts ONLY "2MiB", "5MiB" or "10MiB". Anything else is rejected
# with a warning and silently replaced by 5MiB -- which is what this plugin
# actually ran on throughout emulator testing, because this field previously
# said "12MiB". Speech worked there at 5MiB.
#
# 10MiB is set here for headroom, but it takes that memory from the game. If
# the game misbehaves on hardware, dropping back to 5MiB is the first thing to
# try, and it is known to be enough for speech.
MemorySize: 10MiB
